      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 THE OFFERING 12 SUMMARY FINANCIAL DATA 15 RISK FACTORS 17 SPECIAL NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 57 MARKET, INDUSTRY AND OTHER DATA 58 USE OF PROCEEDS 59 DIVIDEND POLICY 61 CAPITALIZATION 62 DILUTION 65 MANAGEMENT\u2019S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND RESULTS OF OPERATIO NS 68 BUSINESS 81 MANAGEMENT 108 EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION 114 CERTAIN RELATIONSHIPS AND RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS 123 PRINCIPAL STOCKHOLDERS 126 DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES 129 SHARES ELIGIBLE FOR FUTURE SALE 139 UNDERWRITING 142 LEGAL MATTERS 146 EXPERTS 146 WHERE YOU CAN FIND additional INFORMATION 146 DISCLOSURE OF COMMISSION POSITION ON INDEMNIFICATION FOR SECURITIES ACT LIABILITIES 146 INDEX TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS F-1 i Table of Contents ABOUT THIS PROSPECTUS We have not, and the underwriters have not, authorized anyone to provide any information to you or to make any rep",
